        "original_id": "39ad67e8-f18d-5bf5-9ff4-336c489ee1e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Shadows Wake Me\n- People: Damhnait Doyle, Ken Myhr, Jane Siberry\n- Organizations: Latitude Records, EMI Music Canada\n- Projects: Cowboy Junkies\n- Topics: 1996 in music\n\nFacts:\n- In 1996, Damhnait Doyle released Shadows Wake Me as her first studio album.\n- Shadows Wake Me was released on the indie label Latitude Records and was later released by EMI Music Canada.\n- Ken Myhr produced Shadows Wake Me.\n- Before producing Shadows Wake Me, Ken Myhr had worked with Jane Siberry and Cowboy Junkies.\n- Cowboy Junkies are a Canadian alternative country, blues, and folk rock band.",
